5. **Add Error Handling**:
   - Enhance error handling throughout the application, particularly when reading files or rendering templates. This will help provide feedback if something goes wrong, making debugging easier during development and testing.

By addressing these areas, the project will be more robust and aligned with the expected behaviors indicated by the unit tests.

